  "span_id": "3a9a8280-06ac-5fb4-a746-3ad24e63d09f",
  "range": [
   0,
   21
  ],
  "text": "With the Hide action,",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "F"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.hide",
  "leaf": "b2cdbf59-5d8d-5361-b1e6-f34b43721962",
  "span_id": "60800abf-1d00-52f7-a438-087fe763d14c",
  "range": [
   21,
   47
  ],
  "text": " you try to hide yourself.",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.hide",
  "leaf": "b2cdbf59-5d8d-5361-b1e6-f34b43721962",
  "span_id": "8cb55868-c8d8-56f5-a1fe-d749985bae64",
  "range": [
   47,
   111
  ],
  "text": " To do so, you must succeed on a DC 15 Dexterity (Stealth) check",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.hide",
  "leaf": "b2cdbf59-5d8d-5361-b1e6-f34b43721962",
  "span_id": "598ce56e-c4d5-5572-881a-1deabbba80b7",
  "range": [
   111,
   238
  ],
  "text": " while you’re Heavily Obscured or behind Three-Quarters Cover or Total Cover, and you must be out of any enemy’s line of sight;",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.hide",
  "leaf": "b2cdbf59-5d8d-5361-b1e6-f34b43721962",
  "span_id": "95ffc440-7a4c-567e-b36b-8c9d52e61612",
  "range": [
   238,
   305
  ],
  "text": " if you can see a creature, you can discern whether it can see you.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.hide",
  "leaf": "b2cdbf59-5d8d-5361-b1e6-f34b43721962",
  "span_id": "5bf12175-7b2e-505d-8670-c0ac966d2630",
  "range": [
   305,
   375
  ],
  "text": " On a successful check, you have the Invisible condition while hidden.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.hide",
  "leaf": "b2cdbf59-5d8d-5361-b1e6-f34b43721962",
  "span_id": "38d60326-4e0b-5fb5-8f7b-e202607445b3",
  "range": [
   375,
   485
  ],
  "text": " Make note of your check’s total, which is the DC for a creature to find you with a Wisdom (Perception) check.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.hide",
  "leaf": "b2cdbf59-5d8d-5361-b1e6-f34b43721962",
  "span_id": "ee0c9390-a930-544b-bc9e-a9aaef163b63",
  "range": [
   485,
   684
  ],
  "text": " You stop being hidden immediately after any of the following occurs: you make a sound louder than a whisper, an enemy finds you, you make an attack roll, or you cast a spell with a Verbal component.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "6773ee2a-7cf1-5d13-aba0-a85781b9cf99",
  "span_id": "773023b4-e8df-55e9-8b3c-397d50db82ef",
  "range": [
   0,
   18
  ],
  "text": "Influence [Action]",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "ab01adba-10fd-55b2-9ee5-a2c7122d4e8f",
  "span_id": "862a1d6a-f209-5565-af9c-f7abb4aa69e3",
  "range": [
   0,
   26
  ],
  "text": "With the Influence action,",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "F"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "ab01adba-10fd-55b2-9ee5-a2c7122d4e8f",
  "span_id": "05652585-ae26-5664-876b-7e85f8bd4db2",
  "range": [
   26,
   192
  ],
  "text": " you urge a monster to do something. Describe or roleplay how you’re communicating with the monster. Are you trying to deceive, intimidate, amuse, or gently persuade?",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "ab01adba-10fd-55b2-9ee5-a2c7122d4e8f",
  "span_id": "c774f247-33de-5eb8-8ec4-7284bdf805d5",
  "range": [
   192,
   388
  ],
  "text": " The GM then determines whether the monster feels willing, unwilling, or hesitant due to your interaction; this determination establishes whether an ability check is necessary, as explained below.",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "P"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "d1a853d4-3e28-5dfc-b704-cffef3fceabe",
  "span_id": "8bcc1f41-9493-5b1d-9b8d-20ab71613d81",
  "range": [
   0,
   8
  ],
  "text": "Willing.",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "C"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "eeda1b62-45de-576a-82a5-e5cbea43056c",
  "span_id": "ae3a5b14-47ec-5da9-a8db-2c0d8e5f09e9",
  "range": [
   0,
   80
  ],
  "text": "If your urging aligns with the monster’s desires, no ability check is necessary;",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "F"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "eeda1b62-45de-576a-82a5-e5cbea43056c",
  "span_id": "c7354e48-9267-509b-a8ec-8170166ef7a5",
  "range": [
   80,
   135
  ],
  "text": " the monster fulfills your request in a way it prefers.",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "P"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "72e486bb-4adb-5959-852e-0d8668bf7f93",
  "span_id": "893e492d-f789-5d0c-9f42-0789eb456044",
  "range": [
   0,
   10
  ],
  "text": "Unwilling.",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "C"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "2db001c2-80f4-5ddf-bbfb-1a0ac32e271c",
  "span_id": "15722618-a346-50a1-83c9-bd6fda6aef31",
  "range": [
   0,
   102
  ],
  "text": "If your urging is repugnant to the monster or counter to its alignment, no ability check is necessary;",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "F"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "2db001c2-80f4-5ddf-bbfb-1a0ac32e271c",
  "span_id": "a46853d5-d254-5d88-95fc-e39a3dd28885",
  "range": [
   102,
   121
  ],
  "text": " it doesn’t comply.",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "P"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "f45c09d8-e12a-5f96-8e4b-5839dae451f4",
  "span_id": "83ef0f35-7bf9-5c17-9e0a-24c43268b586",
  "range": [
   0,
   9
  ],
  "text": "Hesitant.",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "1fc21186-9145-5d1d-92c4-3a392504139b",
  "span_id": "9ce8e846-50dc-5e8d-a659-216a30bc4d28",
  "range": [
   0,
   221
  ],
  "text": "If you urge the monster to do something that it is hesitant to do, you must make an ability check, which is affected by the monster’s attitude: Indifferent, Friendly, or Hostile, each of which is defined in this glossary.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "1fc21186-9145-5d1d-92c4-3a392504139b",
  "span_id": "2e362c4d-8ded-5d65-a7b4-17e54f73e519",
  "range": [
   221,
   335
  ],
  "text": " The Influence Checks table suggests which ability check to make based on how you’re interacting with the monster.",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "1fc21186-9145-5d1d-92c4-3a392504139b",
  "span_id": "21fdcacf-86f3-5ca1-b79f-2c5d3603ab1b",
  "range": [
   335,
   454
  ],
  "text": " The GM chooses the check, which has a default DC equal to 15 or the monster’s Intelligence score, whichever is higher.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "1fc21186-9145-5d1d-92c4-3a392504139b",
  "span_id": "e11ca4e2-d86d-54cd-8884-43e2f4792ed3",
  "range": [
   454,
   616
  ],
  "text": " On a successful check, the monster does as urged. On a failed check, you must wait 24 hours (or a duration set by the GM) before urging it in the same way again.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.influence",
  "leaf": "1fc21186-9145-5d1d-92c4-3a392504139b",
  "span_id": "07bf6658-78ad-58a1-9bc1-2bf2eaf53ef3",
  "range": [
   616,
   633
  ],
