  "span_id": "85d510cc-2034-57ff-aab4-89c372d0f080",
  "range": [
   0,
   14
  ],
  "text": "Ready [Action]",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "af20f466-ce0c-5790-9912-0c93dae7211a",
  "span_id": "538e17c4-fa90-58a2-b8ed-f84eb2ce4c72",
  "range": [
   0,
   25
  ],
  "text": "You take the Ready action",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "F"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "af20f466-ce0c-5790-9912-0c93dae7211a",
  "span_id": "68ae067a-04ac-5fbd-aeb2-3a0113c29cee",
  "range": [
   25,
   200
  ],
  "text": " to wait for a particular circumstance before you act. To do so, you take this action on your turn, which lets you act by taking a Reaction before the start of your next turn.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "af20f466-ce0c-5790-9912-0c93dae7211a",
  "span_id": "fb7e343e-d6e5-5028-9707-f31e61717ee2",
  "range": [
   200,
   276
  ],
  "text": " First, you decide what perceivable circumstance will trigger your Reaction.",
  "disposition": "substantive",
  "kind": "P"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "af20f466-ce0c-5790-9912-0c93dae7211a",
  "span_id": "c4c8cd4c-fb96-507b-9214-393da1da185c",
  "range": [
   276,
   405
  ],
  "text": " Then, you choose the action you will take in response to that trigger, or you choose to move up to your Speed in response to it.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "af20f466-ce0c-5790-9912-0c93dae7211a",
  "span_id": "f1df1ccc-0301-5966-9d19-f139396d687f",
  "range": [
   405,
   451
  ],
  "text": " Examples include “If the cultist steps on the",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "1022361f-12cf-5e93-93d5-f290c6640282",
  "span_id": "34f06ac3-f281-5581-8dae-cc71996cfe71",
  "range": [
   0,
   96
  ],
  "text": "trapdoor, I’ll pull the lever that opens it,” and “If the zombie steps next to me, I move away.”",
  "disposition": "supporting_authority",
  "kind": "R"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "1022361f-12cf-5e93-93d5-f290c6640282",
  "span_id": "6a9c9af3-cd52-54ff-9559-d1b109fbd2ac",
  "range": [
   96,
   211
  ],
  "text": " When the trigger occurs, you can either take your Reaction right after the trigger finishes or ignore the trigger.",
  "disposition": "unresolved",
  "kind": "U"
 },
 {
  "record": "action.ready",
  "leaf": "1022361f-12cf-5e93-93d5-f290c6640282",
  "span_id": "baa06747-0fe6-59c2-90bb-32de6cd1e373",
  "range": [
   211,
   382
